        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-7903, 4-5/8 Inch Southwestern Cabinet Knob Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob rose can be used with almost any cabinet knob such as the <a href=\"/products/double-ringed-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-708\">Double Ringed Cabinet Knob</a> or the <a href=\"/products/modern-square-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-9316\">Modern Square Cabinet Knob</a>. The unique shape along with the decorative nailhead designs of the Southwestern Cabinet Knob Backplate give it a rustic feel. It has a 4-5/8 inch overall length so it will neither be lost to nor overwhelm most cabinet pulls. This cabinet knob rose is available in 5 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/southwestern-cabinet-pull-backplate-rk-international-bp-7902\"><b>Southwestern Backplate For Cabinet Pulls</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International BP-7903, Southwestern Cabinet Knob Backplate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
